    "quote": "To evaluate the impact of the weighting parameters of the domain discrepancy and domain discrimination components within the domain adaptation loss on model performance, a parameter sensitivity analysis was conducted for λ1 and λ2. The experimental results are shown in Fig. 7, based on transfer task S1. As observed, the model achieves the best diagnostic accuracy of 98.72% when λ1 = 0.3 and λ2 = 0.00001. Therefore, this parameter setting is adopted in the subsequent experiments to ensure optimal transfer performance.",
